{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48909","headline":"南阳见柳 · 崔橹","name":"南阳见柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜来风入最高枝，罥断愁肠几尺丝。\n楚塞曾吟烟午处，曲江长忆雪晴时。\n金衔细毂萦回岸，戍笛牛歌远近陂。\n还把旧年惆怅意，武安城下一吟诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔橹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}